+        <t indent="0" pn="section-4.1-5">In essence, then, one XML stream functions as an envelope for the XML stanzas sent during a session and another XML stream functions as an envelope for the XML stanzas received during a session.  We can represent this in a simplistic fashion as follows.</t>
