-Roles:  Client <bcp14>SHOULD</bcp14>, Server <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-15-43">Feature:  stream-attribute-initial-lang
-Description:  Include an 'xml:lang' attribute in the initial stream
-   header.
