-Roles:  Client <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>, Server <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-15-62">Feature:  xml-namespace-content-server
-Description:  Support 'jabber:server' as a content namespace.
-Section:  Section 4.8.2
-Roles:  Client N/A, Server <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-15-63">Feature:  xml-namespace-streams-declaration
-Description:  Ensure that there is a namespace declaration for the
-   'http://etherx.jabber.org/streams' namespace.
