-Roles:  Client <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>, Server <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-15-66">Feature:  xml-restriction-dtd
-Description:  Do not generate or accept internal or external DTD
-   subsets.
-Section:  Section 11.1
-Roles:  Client <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>, Server <bcp14>MUST</bcp14>.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-15-67">Feature:  xml-restriction-pi
-Description:  Do not generate or accept XML processing instructions.
