+      <dd pn="section-15-8.2">sasl-correlate</dd>
+      <dt pn="section-15-8.3">Description:</dt>
+      <dd pn="section-15-8.4">When authenticating a stream peer using SASL, correlate the authentication identifier resulting from SASL negotiation with the 'from' address (if any) of the stream header it received from the peer.</dd>
