+      <dd pn="section-15-50.2">stream-reconnect</dd>
+      <dt pn="section-15-50.3">Description:</dt>
+      <dd pn="section-15-50.4">Reconnect with exponential backoff if a TCP connection is terminated unexpectedly.</dd>
+      <dt pn="section-15-50.5">Section:</dt>
+      <dd pn="section-15-50.6"><xref target="section-3.3" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 3.3"/></dd>
